  "post_content": "<p>La Font de Dins de Onda y la sede de la Penya Barcelonista, con menos ambiente que en otras ocasiones,&nbsp;fueron anoche el epicentro durante la final de la Copa del Rey de f&uacute;tbol entre el Bilbao y el Barcelona. Despu&eacute;s, un grupo&nbsp;reducido de cul&eacute;s celebr&oacute; el triunfo por 3-0 en el Raval de Sant Josep.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8097.jpg\" alt=\"img_8097\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8098.jpg\" alt=\"img_8098\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8099.jpg\" alt=\"img_8099\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8100.jpg\" alt=\"img_8100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8128.jpg\" alt=\"img_8128\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8129.jpg\" alt=\"img_8129\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8130.jpg\" alt=\"img_8130\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8131.jpg\" alt=\"img_8131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8132.jpg\" alt=\"img_8132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcoparei/img_8133.jpg\" alt=\"img_8133\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalcopare